WEBVTT

00:01:56.924 --> 00:02:02.894
It means, "Return and get
it." Learn from the past.

00:02:02.918 --> 00:02:05.695
This pictograph by the Jokwe
people of Angola

00:02:05.719 --> 00:02:09.514
tells the story
of the creation of the world.

00:02:09.538 --> 00:02:14.918
At the top is God,
at the bottom is man, mankind,

00:02:14.942 --> 00:02:19.826
and on the left is the sun,
on the right is the moon.

00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:23.681
All the paths lead to and from God.

00:02:23.705 --> 00:02:28.075
These secret societies
of the Yoruba, Kongo

00:02:28.099 --> 00:02:30.270
and Palo religions